      "id": "claim_e1a17b58276942d8a35e78b12a483408",
      "statement": "mcp-shared is a library (not a Worker) holding the code whose duplication would become a security disagreement — tool classification, scope grammar, OAuth lifecycle, approval wiring — while each connector keeps its own entrypoint, DOs, connect form, and configurator, varying shared behavior only through named hooks.",
