        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a40228f1a793429c944915d3a4207d1d",
      "statement": "tools.ts is the trust boundary: nothing outside it reads tool annotations, and a deployment-level ServerTrust tier (byo vs vetted, read fresh at each use) decides how far a server's self-description is believed.",
      "evidence": [
